==Specialized scout troopers==
While they themselves were specialized stormtroopers,<ref name="Stormtrooper DB" /> further specializations and variants of the scout trooper existed throughout the Imperial Era for various tasks.<ref name="Jedi: Survivor" />
*'''[[Hoth Scout Trooper]]''':<ref name="Web">{{LEGOWeb|url=en-us/product/snowtrooper-battle-pack-75320|text=Snowtrooper™ Battle Pack}}</ref> Scout troopers equipped with heated suits to work in frigid weather, such as on [[Hoth]].<ref name="Complete Vehicles 2018">[[Star Wars: Complete Vehicles (2018)|''Star Wars: Complete Vehicles'' (2018)]]</ref>
*'''[[Stormtrooper Commander|Scout Trooper Commander]]''': [[Stormtrooper Commander]]s who served as scout troopers.<ref name="Fallen Order" />
*'''[[Shield Trooper]]''': Scout troopers equipped with both an electro-baton and shield.<ref name="Jedi: Survivor" />
*'''[[Stormtrooper sniper|Sniper trooper]]''': Scout troopers armed with a sniper rifle.<ref name="Commander" />

